# Letterhead: assigned person only

Applies to **every** application. Drive paint from `application_documents.letterhead_source` (+ `show_letterhead`):

| `letterhead_source` | URL slot |
|---------------------|----------|
| `owner` | `ownerLetterheadUrl` |
| `architect_or_ls` | `consultantLetterheadUrl` (appointed Architect/LS) |
| `consultant` | `consultantLetterheadUrl` (appointed consultant) |

1. Resolve **only** that party’s profile letterhead — never viewer JWT/session, never another party, never HTML/CSS scrape.
2. If that URL is missing → paint **nothing**, but when `show_letterhead` is true still **reserve** logo/footer clearance in `injectPaginatedStyles` (blank band). Do not collapse first-page top / footer just because the image is absent.
3. Implement via `catalogDocumentLetterheadSource` + `resolveLetterheadUrlForVariant` — never hardcode letterhead images in HTML.
